daemon-ingress
==============

The FreshPorts ingress daemon, built and distributed as the FreeBSD
package freshports-ingress (port: FreshPorts/ports freshports-ingress).

This is the daemon that runs ingress. The ingress code itself is in
FreshPorts/ingress-scripts, ingress-modules and ingress-verify.

This repository was split out of FreshPorts/daemontools, which was itself
converted from the daemontools project in the freshports-1 Subversion
repository (svn+ssh://svn.int.unixathome.org/freshports-1). README.md in
FreshPorts/daemontools describes that conversion. The split is done by
split-daemontools.sh in ~/src/freshports/git-conversion/.


Where the code lived
--------------------

The daemon began as a copy of the freshports daemon and has been renamed
since. This repository follows it through each name, so its history
starts on 2002-02-08:

  SVN revisions   daemontools path                     notes
  -------------   ----------------------------------   ----------------------
  r888 - r5049    trunk/freshports                     the original daemon
  r5050 - r5375   trunk/fp-daemon                      renamed in r5050
  r5376 - r5385   branches/git/fp-daemon               branch created r5376
  r5386 - r5416   branches/git/fp-ingress              copied from fp-daemon
  r5417 onward    branches/git/ingress                 renamed in r5417

Each commit keeps only that directory, moved to the top of the repository;
commits that did not touch it are dropped. Every commit keeps its
git-svn-id: trailer, giving the original Subversion path and revision.

History up to r5385 is the same as daemon-freshports, which continued from
fp-daemon after the copy.


Branches
--------

  main   branches/git, as traced above


Tags
----

The SVN tags form one version series under two names. The prefixes are
dropped so that each tag name is the package version, which is what a port
with USE_GITHUB expects:

  SVN tag                       git tag            created
  ---------------------------   ----------------   ----------
  fp-ingress-2.0.0 .. 2.0.2     2.0.0 .. 2.0.2     2020-07-18
  ingress-2.0.3, 2.0.4          2.0.3, 2.0.4       2020-07-19

Each tag is annotated with the tagger, date and message of the SVN
revision that created it, and points at the commit for the revision it was
copied from. Its tree was checked to be identical to the corresponding tag
in FreshPorts/daemontools before it was created.

Two tags are the release as created. In each, a second svn copy onto the
existing tag nested a copy inside it; that nested copy is not included:

  2.0.1   created r5402; fp-ingress/ nested in r5408
  2.0.4   created r5427; ingress/ nested in r5428


Releasing
---------

Previously cut-freshports-ingress (in packaging-for-svn) tagged a release
in SVN, exported it, and copied the tarball to pkg01. With this repository
a release is a git tag named for the version; the port can fetch it with:

  USE_GITHUB=	yes
  GH_ACCOUNT=	FreshPorts
  GH_PROJECT=	daemon-ingress


Not converted
-------------

  - svn:ignore properties; there is no .gitignore.
  - $Id$ keywords, which remain unexpanded as stored in SVN.
